## 七、协议报文格式（baidu_std）

```
+--------+-----------+----------+------------------+------------------+
| "PRPC" | body_size | meta_size|     RpcMeta      |    payload       |
| 4 byte | 4 byte    | 4 byte   |   (protobuf)     |  (pb + attach)   |
+--------+-----------+----------+------------------+------------------+
|<----------- 12 byte header ---------------------->|<-- body_size -->|
```

- `body_size = meta_size + payload_size`
- `payload` = 序列化后的 request/response message + attachment
